readme='''# R29: startup ambience is a live route

Normal StartMenu displays code-drawn bubble FV-286EA25FDB27, sparkle FV-D4719703FA36 and moon FV-2FA8B6B257A3 above the painted boot artwork. The old intro.storybook retired label conflated this ambience stage with the separate retained IntroOverlay. Normal displayed startup sets intro_active to block gameplay input, selects this ambient stage and draws layer21 above StartMenu20. [Source and route correction](ROUTE_CORRECTION.json). Frozen entry/role bodies remain historical; this overlay supplies their effective current disposition.

Sixteen actual official Godot4.7.2 Mobile/Speedy native frames at1280x720/1600x720 cover normal/continuous views and the natural22second idle moon rise (0/25/50/75percent/settle), plus raw background touch. Both fresh private profiles were installed before Main; all8 normal-save hashes were unchanged and teardown passed. All16 images were directly inspected and have distinct exact PNG hashes. These are bounded desktop captures; QA11/device/child/owner and saved/options/reentry/longloop coverage remain open. [Captures](CAPTURE_INDEX.json), [contract](CAPTURE_CONTRACT.json), [ten-axis review](REVIEW.json).

The flat moon crosses the Options icon/text/panel in both layouts. Wide-layout gutters expose the primitive bubbles and star. Proposed bounded repair: reuse the unchanged painted boot artwork and retire redundant StartMenu ambience, including its idle moon. No new drawing is needed. Publish and anonymously verify this current context before that repair; R29 makes no production or source-pixel edits.

[Source census](CATALOGUE_SOURCE_CENSUS.json):100 catalogue registrations,300 source slots (200continuous/100idle),29 raw motif tokens mapped to26 existing named designs. The gear renderer design has0 catalogue slots. These are source counts; other registrations' reachability/suspension/occlusion and full caller closure remain unknown. The catalogue's intro descriptive source label is stale for displayed startup. The inherited live_v4/route_dispositions.json citation was absent at the assumed local path and had no matching path in the exact frozen R6 payload tree. This unresolved historical reference is explicit; current evidence replaces the retired-stage assumption.

[Tally](tally.json):225 known roles/30families;54 existing roles/12families have partial current context.2748 bounded historical credits/3031 retained native files,283 excluded.78/176 overlapping entries partial,0 complete,98 without a slice; all176 remain incomplete.369 primitive scopes:18 inventory-dispositioned/351 unresolved,plus2 supplemental compositors. One existing hand sample/four per-piece review requests remain pending. Approved/integrated/runtime-verified/accepted removed artwork:0. Whole-game individual piece/screen/regression totals remain unknown. SVG counts are never removal evidence.

[Plan](PLAN.json), [source hashes](SOURCES.json), [script gates](SCRIPT_GATES.json), [machine gates](GATES.json), [manifest](MANIFEST.json), [anonymous receipt](REMOTE_VERIFICATION.json), [receipt gates](RECEIPT_GATES.json). CHG-036 and the audit-impact record cover this additive packet and navigation/authority changes. Publication is separate from creative/runtime/device/child/owner acceptance.
'''
(P/'README.md').write_text(readme,encoding='utf-8',newline='\n')
